!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!
!! NO .kicad_pro NEXT TO 'board.kicad_pcb' (#441)
!!
!! The sibling project carries the board's DRC floor. Without it this
!! step resolves clearances from the STOCK netclass, which can be LOOSER
!! than the copper already on the board:
!!   - KiCad will then report phantom sub-clearance DRC on correct copper
!!   - CLI and GUI runs will route DIFFERENT copper from this same board
!!
!! If this board was copied or renamed, bring its .kicad_pro along:
!!   python3 py_router/copy_board.py src.kicad_pcb dst.kicad_pcb
!! (Ignore only if this is a pristine board that has never been routed.)
